                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Each kWh got 9.5% cleaner, yet power-sector emissions rose 27%: generation grew 40%, and all the fossil growth was coal.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#0b0b0b"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Malaysia is 3rd of 6 ASEAN peers on renewable share but 5th of 6 on carbon intensity (606 g/kWh, 2025): the coal-to-gas balance matters too.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#0b0b0b"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
